### Upload avatar
POST http://localhost:8080/api/avatar/upload
Content-Type: multipart/form-data; boundary=WebAppBoundary

--WebAppBoundary
Content-Disposition: form-data; name="file"; filename="cat.jpg"
Content-Type: image/jpeg

< ../src/test/resources/cat.jpg
--WebAppBoundary--

### Upload other avatar
POST http://localhost:8080/api/avatar/upload
Content-Type: multipart/form-data; boundary=WebAppBoundary

--WebAppBoundary
Content-Disposition: form-data; name="file"; filename="cat_on_snow.jpg"
Content-Type: image/jpeg

< ../src/test/resources/cat_on_snow.jpg
--WebAppBoundary--

### Get avatar
GET http://localhost:8080/api/avatar/1
